; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\きしむドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Haah, we finally made it back..." 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You must be worn out, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">. Dad's family home really is far away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, I'm a little sleepy..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, you take a nap. I have somewhere to go for a bit, so watch the house."</STYLE><PG>
"Where are you going?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The supermarket. I threw out almost everything in the fridge the day before yesterday."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay, see you later."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\きしむドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Maybe I'll watch some TV..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It's now 2:30 in the afternoon. Time for 'Iizawa Ii-jan♪.' [TN: ii-jan means "nice, huh?" and puns on Iizawa.] </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Now then, today again we bring you the prefecture's bargains and juicy tips... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">or so we'd like to. That incident has happened again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Here is a follow-up on the brutal killing of junior high students discovered in Megasawa City this morning. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Once again, two people were brutally killed, and it is increasingly believed that the estimated time of death was around yesterday evening. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is the April 8th tragedy unavoidable? We covered the third Megasawa City case. Please watch the video."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―Megasawa City, in Iizawa Prefecture, where we live. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This morning, two junior high students living in the city were found dead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Despite this heartbreaking incident occurring, residents voiced surprising reactions.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―This housewife:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it is April 8th, after all. I figured it would happen about now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Q: You're not very surprised?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, I've gotten used to it by now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―And this man who looks like an office worker:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's always people connected with schools, right? I don't think I'll be attacked."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Q: You're not scared?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What scares me is when my son starts elementary school."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―Furthermore, this woman told us this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I saw the culprit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Q: You saw the culprit!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, I couldn't really see what it looked like, but it was incredibly fast. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It just, whoosh, disappeared. That wasn't a human's movement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I really do think it's the work of a ghost."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Q: You couldn't make out its appearance?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, no, not at all. I could tell it was something person-like, but it ran off, whoosh, so fast I couldn't make out its appearance, and vanished... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">At least, it's not human!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Q: So you do think it's the spiriting-away's doing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Definitely! There's no way that was a human!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Dad..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
